        "snippet": "Treatment options for depression include psychotherapy, antidepressant medications, and in some cases, brain stimulation therapies. Lifestyle changes, such as exercise and healthy eating, can also be beneficial. The most effective approach often involves a combination of these treatments tailored to the individual's specific needs.",
